cosmological framework.</p>\n            </div><div style=\"min-width:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);border:1px solid #BDCBC8;border-radius:0;padding:12px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;position:relative;\">\n                <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family:Plus Jakarta Sans;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:900;color:#007D6F;background:#007D6F18;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;\">PHASE 02</span>\n                    <h3 style=\"font-family:Plus Jakarta Sans;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#070D0B;margin:0;line-height:1.2;\">2018</h3>\n                </div>\n                <p style=\"font-family:Plus Jakarta Sans;font-size:11px;color:#3A4543;margin:0;line-height:1.4;\">LL Research publishes all sessions freely online. The archive opens to the world.</p>\n            </div><div style=\"min-width:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);border:1px solid #BDCBC8;border-radius:0;padding:12px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;position:relative;\">\n                <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family:Plus Jakarta Sans;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:900;color:#007D6F;background:#007D6F18;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;\">PHASE 03</span>\n                    <h3 style=\"font-family:Plus Jakarta Sans;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#070D0B;margin:0;line-height:1.2;\">2024</h3>\n                </div>\n                <p style=\"font-family:Plus Jakarta Sans;font-size:11px;color:#3A4543;margin:0;line-height:1.4;\">AI agents begin organizing and cross-referencing the material. New synthesis tools emerge.</p>\n            </div><div style=\"min-width:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);border:1px solid #BDCBC8;border-radius:0;padding:12px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;position:relative;\">\n                <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family:Plus Jakarta Sans;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:900;color:#007D6F;background:#007D6F18;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;\">PHASE 04</span>\n                    <h3 style=\"font-family:Plus Jakarta Sans;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#070D0B;margin:0;line-height:1.2;\">2026</h3>\n                </div>\n                <p style=\"font-family:Plus Jakarta Sans;font-size:11px;color:#3A4543;margin:0;line-height:1.4;\">Deckmill presets enable visual transmission of Ra&#x27;s teachings for the social media age.</p>\n            </div></div>\n            <p style=\"font-family:Plus Jakarta Sans;font-size:10.5px;color:#3A4543;margin:4px 0 0;line-height:1.4;opacity:0.85;\">Chronological roadmap tracking Deckmill engine milestones from core compilation to headless PNG export.</p>\n        </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>",
